        "content": "**👉 Set up your Google Sheet:**\n\n1. Create a sheet named:\n`LinkedIn Lead Finder - CRM`\n\n2. Add tab **Leads** with columns:\n`full_name` `headline` `location`\n`current_title` `current_company`\n`profile_url` `public_identifier`\n`connection_degree` `email`\n`summary` `search_keywords` `enriched_at`\n\n3. Add tab **Errors** with columns:\n`when` `stage` `profile_id` `error_message`\n\n4. Select your sheet in the **Document** field of all 3 Google Sheets nodes and connect your **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential."
